      style="display:none;position:absolute;top:-2px;right:-2px;background:#c4511a;color:white;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;min-width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 4px;">!</span>
